Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.93,0:00:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,(邪恶力量)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.93,0:00:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,(试播集)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.11,0:00:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,(编剧)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.14,0:00:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,(埃里克·克莱普克)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.23,0:00:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.87,0:00:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.43,0:00:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是温家双煞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.08,0:00:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.54,0:00:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,玛姬  斯沃恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie, Siobhan...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.30,0:00:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你们把这当玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}...is this some kind of a joke to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.83,0:00:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,斯沃恩  这场戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Siobhan, this scene takes place
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是发生在卡文·爱德路德\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the events of Carver Edlund's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.59,0:01:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,未出版的大作《月之暗面》(S05E16)之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}unpublished masterpiece "Dark side of the moon".
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你的萨姆护身符呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning, where is the Samulet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我给摘下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.31,0:01:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,总是打到我的嘴唇\N{\fnArial\fs30}It kept hitting me in the lips, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.97,0:01:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那个护身符是温家兄弟的亲情象征\N{\fnArial\fs30}That amulet is a symbol of the Winchesters' brotherly love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你得为大家忍忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to take one for the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.59,0:01:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是为了大学学分才来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm just here for the college credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.63,0:01:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你好大胆\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.98,0:01:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}People!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.33,0:01:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你们够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}People!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.33,0:01:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经忍了这破剧三周了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I have had three weeks of this crap show,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.20,0:01:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I am done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.19,0:01:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,戏剧部也太戏剧化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is too much drama in the drama department.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.86,0:01:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我明早去找萨拉查校长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to principal Salazar in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.91,0:01:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不  钱德勒老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no, Mrs. Chandler,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.25,0:01:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-结束了  玛丽 - 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's over, Marie. - please...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.46,0:01:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  我们重新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, everybody back to one!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.03,0:01:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,除非我们真被叫停  演出要继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until we are all suspended, the show must go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.26,0:01:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他们为什么不能像普通的小讨厌鬼那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why couldn't they just do "Godspell,"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.51,0:01:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,演《摇滚福音》呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}like good little skanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.88,0:01:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,却非得演这么个天马行空的烂恐怖故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead, it's this awful, unbelievable horror story.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.55,0:02:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那种事哪里会有啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that stuff really happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.69,0:02:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,戏剧应该表现生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theater is about life, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.09,0:02:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,真理  事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth... truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.40,0:02:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,, 《凶鬼恶灵》有什么真实可言啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the truth in "Supernatural"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.45,0:02:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,放开  放开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, get it off! Get it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.42,0:02:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,(凶鬼恶灵)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.95,0:02:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,接近了  但还是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's close, but it just...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.22,0:02:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,还需要点...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It needs a little more, eh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:03:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第10季第5集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.15,0:03:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你起来多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you been up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.82,0:03:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,够长了  还给咱们找到件案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long enough to find us a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.37,0:03:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long enough to...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.77,0:03:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那么你现在都恢复正常了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it that means you're feeling back to normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.46,0:03:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,对我们来说算是正常了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, whatever normal is in our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.84,0:03:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,看这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.11,0:03:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,密歇根州  弗林特一个女校老师失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A teacher at an all-girls school went missing in Flint, Michigan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.64,0:03:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,她当时正要去取车  就消失不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was, uh, headed to her car and then disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.57,0:04:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,再没人见到过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's seen her since.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.08,0:04:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,(老师失踪)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.37,0:04:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩  这里面毫无有古怪的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, there's nothing here to even remotely suggest there's a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.69,0:04:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这里面也没有迹象表明  就绝对没有古怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nothing there that even remotely suggests there isn't a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.14,0:04:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.90,0:04:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,得了  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.75,0:04:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆  去猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, out there hunting...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.91,0:04:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我唯一的正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the only normal I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.57,0:04:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去干活儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.34,0:04:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.99,0:04:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I certainly appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.85,0:04:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好的  谢谢  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it. Thanks, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.24,0:04:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,最后有人见到钱德勒老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the last place Mrs. Chandler was seen by anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.72,0:04:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是在礼堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}was in the auditorium.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.15,0:04:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,她是戏剧部的老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out she's the drama teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.83,0:04:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,玩戏剧的孩子  这可好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theater kids... great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.36,0:04:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-我就演过戏剧呢 -少来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was a theater kid. - Barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.37,0:04:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你演了《我们小镇》  虽说不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did "our town," which was cool,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.80,0:04:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,但后来你又去演那个破音乐剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but then you did that crappy musical.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.09,0:04:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,, 《俄克拉荷马》吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That... "Oklahoma"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.82,0:04:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,休·杰克曼还演过呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hugh Jackman got cast off "Oklahoma""
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.71,0:04:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你是负责舞台布景的  金刚狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ran tech, wolverine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:05:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.08,0:05:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,(音乐剧  仅此一夜)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.61,0:05:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,二位如果还需要什么  尽管说\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you gentlemen need anything else, just let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.07,0:05:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好的  谢谢萨拉查老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Thanks, Mrs. Salazar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.13,0:05:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idjits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这些白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ya idjits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.91,0:05:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就是白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are idjits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.50,0:05:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, assbutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.69,0:05:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, assbutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.91,0:05:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 约翰  玛丽  是一对夫妻 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ John and Mary, husband and wife. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.16,0:05:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 将新生儿子带回家 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Bringing home a brand-new life. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.37,0:05:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 他名叫萨姆 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ His name is Sammy. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.84,0:05:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我是哥哥迪恩 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm big brother Dean. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.98,0:05:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 看似美满家庭  可现实却非如此 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The perfect family Or so it seemed. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.68,0:05:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 恶魔已然开始造访 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The demon's visits had begun. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:06:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 它认定萨姆是选定之人 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It believed Sam was the chosen one. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.40,0:06:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 它烧死了妈妈 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It burned my mother. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.71,0:06:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 还诅咒了弟弟 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And it cursed my brother. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.85,0:06:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 让我们伤心欲绝 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Leaving us in tears. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 走过的路 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ On the road so far. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.60,0:06:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 走过的路 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Yeah, the road so far. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- ∮ 我们驾驶着爸爸的车 ∮  -停\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ∮ We are in dad's car... ∮ - Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.10,0:06:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,去跟灯光部说一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, go talk to the lighting department real quick,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.59,0:06:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们跟斯沃恩谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we're gonna go talk to Siobhan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-搞什么...  -如果有案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What in the h-holy... - If there is a case...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.73,0:06:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,大概跟这个有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably has something to do with all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.61,0:06:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,还用说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ya think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.81,0:06:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-行吗  好的  -是出版商吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay? Good. - Publisher?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.99,0:06:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.91,0:06:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-玛姬  玛丽真是没完没了  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maggie, Marie just never stops. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.21,0:06:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.25,0:06:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐  你们是出版社的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my gosh, a-a-are you guys from the publisher?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.49,0:06:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我是玛丽  编剧/导演\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm... I'm Marie, the writer/director.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.13,0:06:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这是梅芙  舞台监督  那是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Maeve, my stage manager, and that was just a dr--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.26,0:07:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我是特别探员史密斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm, uh, Special Agent Smith.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.48,0:07:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这位是我搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my partner, Special Agent...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.26,0:07:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-史密斯  -也是史密斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Smith. - Smith.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.93,0:07:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是亲属\N{\fnArial\fs30}No relation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.56,0:07:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是来调查...\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-we're here to look into the disappearance...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.22,0:07:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,, 《凶灵恶鬼》怎么还唱上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no singing in "Supernatural."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.50,0:07:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这是玛丽的演绎版本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is Marie's interpretation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.54,0:07:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,如果要唱歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...I mean, if there was singing, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.47,0:07:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这可能性可不大\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's a big "if"...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.29,0:07:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,即使要唱歌  也该是经典摇滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there was singing, it would be classic rock,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.00,0:07:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不会是安德鲁·佛洛依德·韦伯风(音乐剧演员)的\N{\fnArial\fs30}not this... Andrew Floyd Webber crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.81,0:07:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.81,0:07:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-是{\u1}安德鲁·洛伊德·韦伯{\u0}  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Andrew Lloyd Webber. - S-- what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.96,0:07:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们第二幕有安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, we do sing a cover
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.83,0:07:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,唱《前行吧  不羁之子》\N{\fnArial\fs30}of "Carry on Wayward Son" in the second act.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.47,0:07:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-多经典啊  -多经典啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a classic. - It's a classic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.35,0:07:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  总之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Anyways,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.65,0:07:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是为钱德勒老师的失踪而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}w-we're here to talk about the disappearance of Mrs. Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.41,0:07:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,她失踪之前  你们见过她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any chance you two saw her before she vanished?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,她什么时候走的  9点半左右吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She left around like, what, 9:30?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.64,0:07:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,知道她那时候会去哪里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea where she would be headed that time of night?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.88,0:07:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:07:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,或者贩酒店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a liquor store.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.44,0:08:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,或者都去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.96,0:08:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.59,0:08:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,她去年离婚了  闹得很凶\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had a nasty divorce last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.34,0:08:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,她大部分时间都沉溺于...大人果汁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of the time, she's sipping on her, uh... grown-up juice
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.26,0:08:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,要么就不省人事  一般是先喝后醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}or passed out... usually in that order.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.37,0:08:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不怪她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I don't blame her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我要喝50杯果冻酒  外加拿水管使劲冲澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need 50 jello shots and a hose-down
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.44,0:08:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,才能把这洗掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get this stink off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.42,0:08:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,梅芙  来检查下灯光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maeve, we need you to check the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.05,0:08:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,梅芙  是吧  你是舞台监督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maeve, right? You're the stage manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.41,0:08:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是乔迪·米尔斯的替角\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I understudy Jody Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.35,0:08:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么  -很好  很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - That's great. That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.25,0:08:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,乔迪·米尔斯  多棒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody Mills... that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.65,0:08:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那不如你带我去后台转转\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how about you give me a, uh, behind-the-scenes tour
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.33,0:08:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你们导演带我搭档去钱德勒老师的办公室吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}while your director shows my partner Mrs. Chandler's office?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.94,0:08:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.24,0:08:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好的  稍等我们一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Give us a moment, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.75,0:08:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.65,0:08:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我要吐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna throw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.85,0:08:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,其实  也挺不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I got to say, it's kind of charming...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.21,0:08:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,制作水准和...\N{\fnArial\fs30}t-the production value and the...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.78,0:08:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不吗  当然不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No? N-- no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.63,0:08:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我去查电磁干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna check for EMF.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.53,0:08:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你去找...诅咒物体\N{\fnArial\fs30}You... you look for, uh, cursed objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.86,0:09:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这些东西你们都哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell did you get all this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.79,0:09:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,有些是自制的  有些改造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some parts homemade, some parts repurposed,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.41,0:09:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,都很...棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of it...awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.57,0:09:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}D-don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.95,0:09:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,请别乱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.13,0:09:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他们干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.81,0:09:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在排练倾肠戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, they are rehearsing the B.M. scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.14,0:09:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,清肠戏啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bowel-movement scene?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.79,0:09:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.08,0:09:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,倾诉衷肠戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the boy melodrama scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.85,0:09:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他俩在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the scene where the boys get together
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.85,0:09:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,一起开车  或一起靠着宝贝车\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're... they're driving or leaning against baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.49,0:09:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,喝喝啤酒  谈谈感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}drinking a beer, sharing their feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.81,0:09:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,就他们俩  虽然孤独  但拥有彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two of them... alone but together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.15,0:09:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,心灵相通  兄弟联手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bonded, united.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.76,0:09:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他们痛苦的力量...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power of their pain is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.60,0:09:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他们为什么站得那么近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are they standing so close together?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.36,0:09:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,有原因啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.43,0:09:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他们是亲兄弟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know they're brothers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.84,0:09:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.17,0:10:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,但  可以暗示嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...subtext.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.89,0:10:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我说你们往后退退吧  姑娘们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you take a substep back there, ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.15,0:10:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,整个排练期间  你注意到什么异常了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, have you noticed anything strange during the production?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.62,0:10:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,比如  奇怪的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean... any odd noises or...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.12,0:10:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你是指这种吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,或者这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or perhaps this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.01,0:10:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.90,0:10:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.61,0:10:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂了  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I got it. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.07,0:10:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我当初在学校剧负责舞台布景时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, back when I did tech in school,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.56,0:10:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只有两个CD机\N{\fnArial\fs30}we had two cd decks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.03,0:10:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.14,0:10:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去签收快递\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go sign for delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.59,0:10:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,请不要碰任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't touch anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.32,0:11:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.84,0:11:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,(戏剧是生活)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.04,0:11:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这是她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This hers?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.07,0:11:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.01,0:11:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那是第二幕的道具\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a prop from act 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.23,0:11:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我还一直在找呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been looking for that, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.40,0:11:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,, 《凶灵恶鬼》里面没有太空元素啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no space in "Supernatural".
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.36,0:11:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,原著是没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not canonically, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.12,0:11:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但这是改编版的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this is transformative fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.20,0:11:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,同人小说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean fan fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.56,0:11:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,随你怎么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it whatever you like, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.84,0:11:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是受卡文·爱德路德小说启发\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's inspired by Carver Edlund's books...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.29,0:11:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,并做了适当修饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a few embellishments.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.06,0:11:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你也知道  恰克在《最后一战》(S05E22)之后就封笔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, as you know, Chuck stopped writing after "Swan Song".
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.65,0:11:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能让故事就那么结束啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just I couldn't leave it the way that it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.23,0:11:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩不再猎魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Dean not hunting anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,搬去跟莉莎住\N{\fnArial\fs30}living with Lisa,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.69,0:12:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆从地狱回来了  却不去找迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-Sam somehow back from hell but not with Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.02,0:12:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我写了自己的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, um, I wrote my own ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.94,0:12:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己写了结局  还加入了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wrote your own ending... with...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.15,0:12:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,太空船吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spaceships?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.92,0:12:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,还有机器人  忍者\N{\fnArial\fs30}And robots and some ninjas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.66,0:12:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,然后迪恩变成了女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then Dean becomes a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.31,0:12:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,就是几场戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It-- it's just for a few scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.39,0:12:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  大文豪  我其实可以告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Shakespeare, you know that I can actually tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.34,0:12:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆和迪恩后来的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}what really happened with, uh, Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.70,0:12:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,有个朋友帮我拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friend of mine hooked me up with the, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.93,0:12:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,未出版的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unpublished unpublished books.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.67,0:12:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆从地狱回来了  但却没带回来灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Sam came back from hell, but without his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.27,0:12:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,然后小卡从炼狱里带回来一群利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Cass brought in a bunch of Leviathans from purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍比死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, they lost Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.05,0:12:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,然后小卡和迪恩还困在炼狱里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then Cass and Dean got stuck in purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.18,0:12:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆撞了狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam hit a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.62,0:12:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他们遇到一个叫凯文的先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, they met a prophet named Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.45,0:12:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他也死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They lost him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,然后萨姆去进行了一系列测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Sam underwent a series of trials...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.40,0:12:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,以试图关上地狱大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}in an attempt to close the gates of hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.10,0:12:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,而这几乎让他送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which... nearly cost him his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.83,0:12:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,而迪恩呢...变成了恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Dean... well, Dean became a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.14,0:13:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,地狱骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}A knight of hell, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.98,0:13:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,简直是我听过的最狗血的同人小说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is some of the worst fan fiction that I have ever heard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.00,0:13:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, seriously, though, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.11,0:13:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你朋友上哪找到这种破烂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}where'd your friend find this garbage?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的虽然不是杰作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'm not saying that ours is a masterpiece or anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.55,0:13:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,但是  天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}but geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.29,0:13:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我回头给你发点同人小说链接\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have to send you some fic-links later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.94,0:13:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.30,0:13:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,如今的孩子管那叫"抱抱"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids these days call it "Hugging."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.30,0:13:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是节目一部分吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that in the show?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.67,0:13:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.62,0:13:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,斯沃恩和克里斯汀真是一对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Siobhan and Kristen are a couple in real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.12,0:13:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我们第二幕的确有探讨"迪卡"的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although, we do explore the nature of Destiel in act 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.50,0:13:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry... what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.58,0:13:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,就是暗示啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's just subtext.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.39,0:13:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不过嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, then again, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.09,0:13:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,暗示当然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't spell "subtex" without...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.83,0:13:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,性方面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}s-e-x.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.57,0:13:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我真搞不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.51,0:13:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.61,0:14:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是叫"迪西迪奥"吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, shouldn't it be "Dea-stiel"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.82,0:14:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧  这就是你的吐槽点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? That's your issue with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.14,0:14:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,当然不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, of course it's not my issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.60,0:14:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,话说  "萨卡"  "萨西迪奥"怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, how about... "Sastiel," "Samstiel"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.42,0:14:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,行了  我告诉你  你要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, all right, you know what? You're gonna do that thing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴  永远别说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you just shut the hell up... forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.80,0:14:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计  没有电磁干扰  没有巫术袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, no EMF, no hex bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.82,0:14:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的道具也都没有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of their props are even remotely hinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.56,0:14:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,除了剧情天马行空  我没查到别的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other than the Charlie Kaufman of it all, I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.68,0:14:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.08,0:14:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,钱德勒老师办公室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, miss Chandler's office
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.02,0:14:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,只有空酒瓶和一堆后悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}was just a pile of empty bottles and regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.48,0:14:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,她大概醉倒在哪个酒吧  或水沟里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's probably facedown in a bar somewhere or a ditch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.90,0:14:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  那么这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, what, this... this whole...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这个音乐剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole musical thing, everything, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.37,0:14:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,就只是巧合吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all a coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.27,0:14:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,根本没有古怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no case?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.58,0:14:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你看到了我漏掉的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you're seeing something I'm not,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.07,0:14:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,否则  迪恩  这里没有古怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, Dean, there's no case here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.07,0:14:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.40,0:14:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,"卡西迪恩"呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}"CasDean"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.34,0:14:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴  进车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your face. Get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.84,0:15:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,玛姬  别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.09,0:15:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}J-- please don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.50,0:15:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,其他人都愿意遵从你的独裁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone else is willing to follow your little dictatorship,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.99,0:15:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.35,0:15:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在跟你说  玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been telling you all along, Marie...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.24,0:15:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不是原著上的  就不该写进戏里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's not canon, then it shouldn't be in the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.54,0:15:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就该按我说的  排演《局外人》\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we should've just done "The outsiders," like I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.72,0:15:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,回来嘛  我们好商量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back inside. We can make this work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.39,0:15:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我明早去找萨拉查校长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to principal Salazar's in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.93,0:15:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我要做钱德勒老师醉得没做到的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna do what Mrs. Chandler was too drunk to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.73,0:15:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这可好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.40,0:16:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.22,0:16:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我问过校长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, checked with the principal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.26,0:16:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,监控录像上毫无结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing on the surveillance tapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.57,0:16:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,警察怎么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the cops think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.05,0:16:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他们唯一找到的线索在垃圾桶旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the only clue they found was by the dumpster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.50,0:16:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在钱德勒老师的手机旁找到了一样的花\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found the Same flower near Mrs. Chandler's cellphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.24,0:16:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-认得吗  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You recognize it? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.51,0:16:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.01,0:17:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你泡了茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made you some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.59,0:17:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.99,0:17:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你们也是来取笑我的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys came here to laugh at me, too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.86,0:17:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我们说说你的朋友到底出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you tell us what happened to your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.57,0:17:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,玛姬辞演了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie quit the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.81,0:17:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,她想阻止我们继续排演\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was trying to get us shut down,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.03,0:17:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就吵了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and so we were fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.32,0:17:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,然后她就走了  我听到了她的尖叫声\N{\fnArial\fs30}The she left and I heard her scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.95,0:17:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我就跑出去帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I ran outside to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.13,0:17:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.09,0:17:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,却看到一个稻草人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I saw a scarecrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.21,0:17:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去跟我们剧里的那个一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looked just like the one from our show, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.61,0:17:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但是是活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.34,0:17:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.91,0:17:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,它用藤蔓捆住了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-it wrapped her up in vines
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.59,0:17:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,然后把她拖到垃圾箱后面去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a-and took her behind a dumpster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.68,0:17:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他们都消失不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then they were both just...gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.87,0:17:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,于是我报了警  一群大人说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I called the cops, and a bunch of adults
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.37,0:17:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想象力太丰富了\N{\fnArial\fs30}just told me I had an overactive imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.32,0:18:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's all real.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.47,0:18:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼魂  天使  恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghosts, angels... demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.67,0:18:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.19,0:18:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都该相信  那都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You both should 'cause it is all real.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.07,0:18:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so are we.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.10,0:18:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我是萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.29,0:18:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.83,0:18:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.96,0:18:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.89,0:18:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿意接受怪物是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm willing to accept that monsters are real,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.71,0:18:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但《凶灵恶鬼》只是小说而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}but those books... are works of fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.75,0:18:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你们太老了  不可能是萨姆和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you guys are way too old to be Sam or Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.06,0:18:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.97,0:18:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我看你们更像鲁弗斯和鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}More of a Rufus/Bobby combo... maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.18,0:18:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  阳光小美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, all right, little miss sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.00,0:18:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是书里所说的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are what the books call hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.46,0:18:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,联调局的猎人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI hunters?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.23,0:18:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.96,0:19:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是《X档案》\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are "X-files."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  行啊  可以这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Yeah. You could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.73,0:19:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你音乐剧用到的稻草人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the scarecrow in your musical...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.48,0:19:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是根据书里改编的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it based on the one from the books?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.18,0:19:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的  我改了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I changed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.94,0:19:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我小时候特别怕当地的一个传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got scared of a local legend when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.98,0:19:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,镇外一座废弃的农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this old, creepy scarecrow
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.14,0:19:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,有个破旧吓人的稻草人\N{\fnArial\fs30}on an abandoned farm outside of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.80,0:19:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们会说如果被它抓到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids used to say if it caught you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.04,0:19:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,它就会把你带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would take you away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.15,0:19:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  如果这个稻草人是根据你的版本来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, if this scarecrow is based off of your version,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.94,0:19:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那钱德勒老师和玛姬就可能还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}then miss Chandler and Maggie might still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.67,0:19:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得稻草人是我们的剧创造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think the scarecrow was created by the play?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.65,0:19:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.33,0:19:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是个幻象怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a tulpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.10,0:19:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,幻象怪是由强烈  专注的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tulpas are monsters that are created by intense,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.26,0:19:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,产生的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}focused energy on an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.95,0:19:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,或者是个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.06,0:19:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  想法要怎么杀啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. How do you kill an idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.76,0:19:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,, 《地狱鬼宅》(S01E17)中  萨姆和迪恩烧掉了一座房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in "Hell House," Sam and Dean burned the house down...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.40,0:19:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,以解决他们对付的那个幻象怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take out the one tulpa they hunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.89,0:19:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  杀掉象征  就能杀掉幻象怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, you kill the symbol, you kill the tulpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.03,0:19:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个好开端\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh, actually a pretty good start.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.90,0:20:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你们剧中的稻草人  是个人还是个道具\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the scarecrow in your play, is it a person or a prop?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.33,0:20:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,道具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.22,0:20:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,很吓人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.17,0:20:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们放在锅炉房了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We keep it in the boiler room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.52,0:20:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's, uh...great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.75,0:20:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你们继续看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, okay, you guys read up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.94,0:20:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,等我们一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give us a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.39,0:20:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so, this doesn't add up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.49,0:20:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,幻象怪需要很多的精神能量才能形成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tulpas require a-a ton of psychic energy to juice up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.00,0:20:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.56,0:20:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,, 《凶灵恶鬼》又不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not like the "Supernatural" books
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.83,0:20:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,, 《纽约时报》的畅销书\N{\fnArial\fs30}are tearing up the New York Times best-seller list,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.03,0:20:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我严重怀疑这部剧有没有满座\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I seriously doubt this play is even sold out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.38,0:20:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,希望没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.14,0:20:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但是呢  那个花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but you know what? This flower...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.68,0:20:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定在什么地方见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I've seen it in the lore somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.21,0:20:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这其中肯定有联系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be a connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.63,0:20:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  你去查那个  我去看看火人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you get on that. I'm gonna take a shot at burning man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.98,0:20:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-嗯  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.03,0:20:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你能带我去锅炉房吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you show me to the boiler room?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.77,0:20:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.08,0:20:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.26,0:20:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gird your loins.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.02,0:21:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,很吓人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's horrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.52,0:21:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.67,0:21:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  吓人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Scary, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.47,0:21:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你要亲手解决这混球吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to piata this asshat?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.68,0:21:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Asshat"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.10,0:21:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不错  挺像迪恩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice. It's, uh, very Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.90,0:21:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不用  他归你了  史密斯探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's all yours, agent Smith.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.75,0:21:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.30,0:21:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去了  我们看到了  我们毁...\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came, we saw, we kicked...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.56,0:21:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不是幻象怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a tulpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.40,0:21:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.64,0:21:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不是幻象怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a tulpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.29,0:22:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,再说一遍  不过更像施瓦辛格那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it one more time, but just a little bit more Arnold,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.11,0:22:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这样...不是幻象怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, like... it's not a tulpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.71,0:22:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.91,0:22:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-是卡利奥佩  -谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Calliope. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.87,0:22:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,史诗女神  缪斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The goddess of epic poetry... the muse.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.86,0:22:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,她跟这个有关  玻璃苣\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's associated with this... the borage or starflower.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.86,0:22:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.81,0:22:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  如果是跟神有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, wait... if this is a god thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.21,0:22:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那稻草人是闹哪样\N{\fnArial\fs30}then what's with the scarecrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.42,0:22:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,据传说  卡利奥佩会根据\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to the lore, Calliope manifests creatures
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.08,0:22:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,自己喜欢的故事创造怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the stories she's tuned into.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.19,0:22:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那么说  稻草人还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...the scarecrow is still alive
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.45,0:22:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,而我们无缘无故烧了我的道具\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we burned my prop for nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.06,0:22:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那东西就该烧掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that thing needed to burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.80,0:22:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,想要毁掉稻草人  就得杀掉卡利奥佩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way to destroy the scarecrow is to kill Calliope.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.39,0:22:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  她会利用自己创造的东西  比如稻草人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right... she uses these manifestations, like the scarecrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.69,0:22:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,来激励作者  并保护他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}to inspire the author and protect them
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.96,0:22:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,直到他们的愿景实现\N{\fnArial\fs30}until their vision is realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.20,0:22:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.91,0:22:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,然后她吃掉作者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then she eats the author.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.64,0:22:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,太糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.48,0:22:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你们如愿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well... you get your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.05,0:22:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们取消音乐剧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's cancel the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.17,0:22:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你的老师和同学都是这么干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what your teacher and classmate did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.75,0:22:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他们想阻止剧目上演\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tried to shut you down,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.24,0:22:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,稻草人绑走了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the scarecrow took them...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.67,0:23:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是为了保护你和你的剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protected you and the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.02,0:23:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那么稻草人是个妖怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, the scarecrow is a boogeyman.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.73,0:23:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得去找这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to take our shot with this, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.08,0:23:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-卡利奥佩  -卡利奥佩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Calliope. - ...Calliope.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.41,0:23:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但想要看到她  得先让...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she won't show herself until...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.65,0:23:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你的愿景实现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your vision is realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.66,0:23:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.48,0:23:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.05,0:23:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,演出必须继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}The show must go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.27,0:23:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我去...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh, why don't I...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.90,0:23:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你们给玛丽鼓鼓劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you guys rally Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.66,0:23:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我去车厢里找些木桩来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna grab some wooden stakes from the trunk
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.59,0:23:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,然后进行祈福\N{\fnArial\fs30}and do the blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.37,0:23:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,玛丽会被吃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Marie gonna get eaten?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.51,0:23:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.20,0:23:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,大幕一拉开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon as that curtain rises,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.21,0:24:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就会去干掉卡利奥佩\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are gonna be there to take out this Calliope.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.76,0:24:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么样了  丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing, champ?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.63,0:24:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这\N{\fnArial\fs30}This...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.28,0:24:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这都怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.66,0:24:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不是我写了这部破剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I hadn't written this dumb play,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.01,0:24:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,就不会发生这种事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}none of this would've happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.30,0:24:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,首先  这部剧不破\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, first of all, uh, the play's not dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.59,0:24:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是不喜欢她的版本吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you didn't believe in this interpretation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.78,0:24:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.62,0:24:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,一点也不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.75,0:24:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}B-but you do, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.73,0:24:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你全心全意地投入进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need you to believe in it with all you got
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.35,0:24:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我们就能杀了卡利奥佩  救出你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that we can kill Calliope and we can save your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.14,0:24:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你能做到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.01,0:24:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.82,0:24:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,如果萨姆和迪恩是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Sam and Dean were real...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.25,0:24:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也不会退缩\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wouldn't back down from a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.52,0:24:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是我可爱  勇敢  无私的萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially my sweet... brave...selfless Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.96,0:24:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他无所不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing he can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.39,0:24:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.05,0:25:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.94,0:25:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么干吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.63,0:25:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我是萨姆的替角  所以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understudy Sam, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.52,0:25:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我去年演独角戏《黑色孤儿》时用了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used this for my one-woman "Orphan Black" show last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.69,0:25:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,只能用这个扮萨姆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's gonna have to work for Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.81,0:25:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,编剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Writer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.92,0:25:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,导演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Director.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.68,0:25:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,演员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.31,0:25:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我要像芭芭拉·史翠珊一样演得出彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna barbra streisand this bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.81,0:25:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,(兄弟之情能否战胜邪恶的黑暗力量)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.82,0:25:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.22,0:25:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.04,0:25:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.96,0:25:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.69,0:25:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.76,0:25:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.47,0:25:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  萨姆护身符呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, samulet?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.33,0:26:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,萨姆护身符\N{\fnArial\fs30}The...samulet?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.39,0:26:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那个护身符是温家兄弟之情的标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}That amulet is a symbol of the Winchesters' brotherly love.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.28,0:26:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我太激动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.33,0:26:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好的  很好  很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, good. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.17,0:26:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.46,0:26:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,摆好姿势  站直了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Posture. Straighten up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.69,0:26:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.56,0:26:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.96,0:26:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  恰克去哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. Where's Chuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.56,0:26:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我很喜欢他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I-I-I love him. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.17,0:26:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但是  说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.78,0:26:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,"作者将自身投入叙事之中"的这种桥段\N{\fnArial\fs30}the whole "author inserting themselves into the narrative" thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.47,0:26:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是很喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's just not my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.51,0:26:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我蛮讨厌{\u1}元小说{\u0}的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kind of hate the meta stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.51,0:26:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.60,0:26:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-我也是  -我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me too. - Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.84,0:26:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  听好了  姑娘们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen up, girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.29,0:26:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你们来演剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}now, I know you're all here
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.88,0:26:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为你都喜欢《凶鬼恶灵》\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you love "Supernatural"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.35,0:26:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上  我本希望我们能演《女巫前传》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I was hoping we'd do "wicked."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.87,0:26:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  那就没这么多麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that'd have been easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.81,0:26:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道关于这个特别版的《凶鬼恶灵》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I know I have expressed some differences of opinion
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.68,0:26:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我表达了一些不同的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}regarding this particular version of "Supernatural,"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.65,0:26:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但是今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, but tonight...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.99,0:26:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,要演出玛丽的版本\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is all about Marie's vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.85,0:27:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这是玛丽的《凶鬼恶灵》\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Marie's "Supernatural."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.19,0:27:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我希望你们上台去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I want you to get out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.06,0:27:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,尽可能按她设想的那样表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I want you to stand as close as she wants you to,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.90,0:27:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,饱含感情地去念台词\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I want you to put as much sub into that text
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.10,0:27:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,把暗示都念出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}as you possibly can.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.98,0:27:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,没有其他的路可走\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no other road,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.41,0:27:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没有其他的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}no other way,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.76,0:27:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,没有别的机会...\N{\fnArial\fs30}no day...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.57,0:27:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,只有今日一搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}but today.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.67,0:27:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他刚刚是引用了《吉屋出租》吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he just quote "Rent"?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.67,0:27:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.19,0:27:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不至于给我们惹麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not enough to get us in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.60,0:27:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你们站到台前  去大放光彩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you get out there and you kick it in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.10,0:27:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  来走一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, bring it in!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.14,0:27:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,抓鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghost...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.25,0:27:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,特工队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Facers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.60,0:27:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好  各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.40,0:27:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来观赏我们的演出  《凶鬼恶灵》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, welcome to our production of "Supernatural."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.61,0:27:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不骗你们  部分内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not gonna lie -- it might be a full-on Gallagher show
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.47,0:27:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,会很有笑点\N{\fnArial\fs30}up in this piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.26,0:27:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,坐在前排的观众们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, so those of you in the front rows
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.71,0:27:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会要用到我们提供的雨衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}may want to use the ponchos we've provided for you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.94,0:27:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,就在座位下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}under your seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.60,0:27:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你们可能会在观剧过程中被打湿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may, in fact, get wet on this ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.55,0:28:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I would -- I would like to thank
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.79,0:28:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,剧组成员...\N{\fnArial\fs30}the, uh, cast and the crew for...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.87,0:28:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  她在拖延时间  我们动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, she's stalling. Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.65,0:28:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.08,0:28:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,幕布  孩子们  演出时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curtain, kids. It's showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.36,0:28:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-我想要感谢...  -幕布准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Um, I'd like to thank - Curtain ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.58,0:28:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,开启音效  开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roll sound. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.59,0:28:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  那么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, um, and... and...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.46,0:28:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来  便是今晚的演出\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-and that concludes our introduction for the night,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.76,0:28:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都坐好\N{\fnArial\fs30}so everybody just sit back,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.60,0:28:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,放松  享受演出吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}relax, and enjoy the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.17,0:28:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone in places.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.50,0:28:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 约翰  玛丽  是一对夫妻 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ John and Mary, husband and wife. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.75,0:28:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 将新生儿子带回家 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Bringing home a brand-new life. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.02,0:28:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 他名叫萨姆 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ His name is Sammy. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.25,0:28:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我是哥哥迪恩 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm big brother Dean. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.60,0:28:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 看似美满家庭  可现实却非如此 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The perfect family Or so it seemed. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.20,0:28:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 恶魔已然开始造访 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The demon's visits had begun. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.63,0:28:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 它认定萨姆是选定之人 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It believed Sam was the chosen one. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.10,0:29:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 它烧死了妈妈 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It burned my mother. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.25,0:29:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 还诅咒了弟弟 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And it cursed my brother. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.53,0:29:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 让我们伤心欲绝 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Leaving us in tears. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.99,0:29:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 走过的路 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ On the road so far. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.28,0:29:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 走过的路 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Yeah, the road so far. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.89,0:29:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我们驾驶着爸爸的车 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We are in dad's car... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.15,0:29:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-看身后  - ∮ 走过这一路 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Turn around! - ∮ On the road so far. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.17,0:29:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 爸爸心意决然  不会放弃 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Dad was driven, no turning back. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.19,0:29:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 不报此仇  誓不罢休 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ He wouldn't stop without the payback. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.66,0:29:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 他训练我们 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ He trained us both to. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.86,0:29:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 追踪  抓捕和杀戮 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ track and hunt and kill. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.27,0:29:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 他夺走了我们自己的意愿 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ He took away our own free will. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.62,0:29:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 于是成了今天这样 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ so that's where we are. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.92,0:29:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 走过的路 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ On the road so far. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.62,0:29:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 拯救生命 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Saving people. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.93,0:29:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 斩妖除魔 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Hunting things. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.18,0:29:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 家族事业 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Family business. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.41,0:30:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 东山再起 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Back in swing. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.35,0:30:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 一路走来至今 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Driving down the road so far. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.24,0:30:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,准备  5  4  3  2  上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready in 5...4...3...2... Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.36,0:30:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,史密斯探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Smith?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.54,0:30:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.73,0:30:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,学校地下室  稻草人把我们弄下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}School's basement. The scarecrow brought us down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.31,0:30:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我几天前就试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I tried that days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.60,0:30:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么  我们被困在这里了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? We're stuck in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.75,0:30:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.85,0:30:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要错过大戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna miss the big show.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.61,0:31:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  你可以明早过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, you can pop in tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.04,0:31:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.18,0:31:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我会...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.35,0:31:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.35,0:31:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}...wait here, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.74,0:31:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.00,0:31:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,照计划行事  明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stick to the plan, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.55,0:31:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,继续唱  直到稻草人来抓你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep singing until the scarecrow comes for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.71,0:31:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我就这么做 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ That's what I'll do. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.37,0:31:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我会在这里等待 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'll just wait here, then. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.94,0:31:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 等待我上场 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Wait for my cue. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.15,0:31:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我将你救出地狱 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I raised you from perdition. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.44,0:31:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 作为上帝的武器 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ to be God's ammunition. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.94,0:31:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 可现在你需要休息 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ But now you need some rest. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.22,0:31:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我还是顾全大局 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ so I will do what's best. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.77,0:31:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 在这里等着就好 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ and just wait here, then. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.39,0:31:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我就这么做 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ That's all I'll do. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.06,0:31:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我会在这里等待 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'll just wait here, then. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.64,0:31:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 等着你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'll wait for you. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.21,0:32:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我吞噬过很多作家  很多故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've consumed many authors, many stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.71,0:32:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,可今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But tonight...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.16,0:32:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,幕布一拉开\N{\fnArial\fs30}as soon as that curtain opened,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.33,0:32:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道这故事有点特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew something special was brewing with this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.51,0:32:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,或许是因为故事中的原型就在现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's because the story's actual inspiration is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.20,0:32:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.73,0:32:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我只能杀了你和你哥哥  找出答案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'm just gonna have to kill you and your brother to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.93,0:32:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你不用等到愿景实现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you have to wait until the vision has been realized?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.29,0:32:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.88,0:32:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,如果要我再忍受一遍第二幕...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I have to sit through that second act one more time...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.46,0:32:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然有机器人和宇宙怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's robots and tentacles in space.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.43,0:32:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不敢想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't even.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.97,0:32:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.41,0:32:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.67,0:32:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 男儿之泪  顺脸庞滑落 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ A single man tear slips down his face. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.65,0:32:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 悄无声息  感情流露 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ He shows emotion without a trace. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.49,0:33:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 躲藏在坚强的外表下 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ He hides behind a mask so strong. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.32,0:33:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 担心自己可能犯下了错误 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Worried that he could be wrong. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.32,0:33:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 真希望他能知道我对他的看法 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I wish that he could see the way I see him. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.24,0:33:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 最棒的哥哥  最完美的人 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The perfect brother, a man without sin. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.14,0:33:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 因为在铁血硬汉的光辉下 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ 'cause underneath the manly sheen. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.91,0:33:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 他只是我哥哥  叫迪恩的男孩 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It is my brother, a boy named Dean. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.15,0:33:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 男儿之泪 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ A single man tear. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.29,0:33:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 男儿之泪 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ A single man tear. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.73,0:33:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 男儿之泪 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ A single man tear. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.51,0:33:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 是我们唯一的恐惧 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ That's all we fear. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.36,0:33:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.23,0:33:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.56,0:33:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 男儿之泪  不轻弹 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ A single man tear that's all I'll spare. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.03,0:33:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  幻想照进现实了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're through the looking glass here, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.05,0:33:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,上食人怪布景  准备牧师戏服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strike the wendigo set. Let's prep the priest costumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.54,0:33:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,萨拉  给替角化妆做头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Sarah, get our understudies into hair and makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.62,0:33:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 如今我被追杀 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Now I'm hunted. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.01,0:33:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么选这个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why this story, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.62,0:34:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么选  《凶鬼恶灵》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, uh, "Supernatural"?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.78,0:34:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,, 《凶鬼恶灵》拥有一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Supernatural" has everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.71,0:34:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,生  死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life, death,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.60,0:34:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,复活  救赎\N{\fnArial\fs30}resurrection, redemption.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.75,0:34:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,木桩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.81,0:34:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But above all...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.34,0:34:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,拿给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.20,0:34:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.15,0:34:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,伴随着美妙的音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}All set to music you can really tap your toe to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.08,0:34:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不是那种乱侃大山的垃圾作品\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't some meandering piece of genre dreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.83,0:34:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,它是部...史诗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's... epic.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.25,0:34:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 但在那破碎的面具下 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ But underneath this broken mask. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.02,0:34:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 是我的父亲  他满腔愤怒 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It is my father, with all his wrath. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.75,0:34:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,而那...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.27,0:34:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,就是我的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, that is my bag of tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.37,0:34:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,尝尝这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bag this!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.69,0:34:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我自己 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ ...my own man. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.63,0:34:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 但在那破碎的面具下 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ But underneath this broken mask. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.33,0:34:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 是我的父亲  他满腔愤怒 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It is my father, with all his wrath. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.23,0:34:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 男儿之泪 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ A single man tear. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.80,0:35:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 男儿之泪 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ A single man tear. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.09,0:35:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 男儿之泪 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ A single man tear. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.29,0:35:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,才不要哭哭啼啼的桥段\N{\fnArial\fs30}No chick-flick moments!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.40,0:36:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠个躬  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a bow, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.95,0:36:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,(幕间休息)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.23,0:36:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,一般到了这时候  萨姆和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usually, this is where Sam and Dean take off
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.72,0:36:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,就会趁有人来得及提问之前开溜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}before anyone asks any questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.37,0:36:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's probably a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.95,0:36:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们救了我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for saving my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.82,0:36:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.38,0:36:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗  如果你剪短头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if you cut your hair a little,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.22,0:36:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你还挺像迪恩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd make a pretty good Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.22,0:36:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.40,0:36:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你干的很不错  丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you did good out there, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.30,0:36:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你也不差\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not so bad yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.72,0:36:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这还挺有...教育意义的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this has been... educational...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.44,0:36:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,从你的角度去思考这个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing the... story from your perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.00,0:36:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,继续写下去  大文豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep writing, Shakespeare.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.25,0:36:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管你不赞同吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if it doesn't match how you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.91,0:36:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我有我的版本  你有你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have my version, and you have yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.26,0:36:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,一分钟  各位  一分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}One minute, folks, one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.88,0:36:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.92,0:37:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.75,0:37:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你不该把这个扔掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never should've thrown this away.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.60,0:37:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这根本没起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It never really worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.75,0:37:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要什么标志来提醒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need a symbol to remind me
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.21,0:37:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我对弟弟的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}how I feel about my brother, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.45,0:37:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take it...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.44,0:37:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.15,0:37:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.74,0:37:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.04,0:37:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,音效  汽车发动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound car start.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.69,0:37:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.74,0:37:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,幕布  拉开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curtain, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.78,0:37:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们可以回去继续瞪着旅馆房间墙壁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we can go back to staring at motel-room walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.98,0:37:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.82,0:37:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.45,0:37:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,傻待着对我们没有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Staying cooped up isn't helping us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.95,0:37:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们得...  -我们得继续上路了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need -- - We need to be back on the road, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.15,0:37:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,做我们最擅长的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}doing what we do best.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.86,0:38:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-那是什么  -我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is that? - I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.55,0:38:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不确定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.34,0:38:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,倾肠戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the, uh, the B.M. Scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.52,0:38:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-救人  猎魔  -清肠戏吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Saving people, hunting things. - Bowel-movement scene?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.18,0:38:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-家族事业  -嘘  不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, the family business. - Shh. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.10,0:38:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,别出声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.27,0:38:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你是对的  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.30,0:38:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out on the road...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.58,0:38:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.56,0:38:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们俩  面对全世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two of us against the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.35,0:38:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,正如她所说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.78,0:38:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 前行吧  我不羁的孩子 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Carry on, my wayward son. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.36,0:38:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 你们最终会找到安宁 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ There'll be peace when you are done. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.85,0:38:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 躺下你们疲惫的身躯 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Lay your weary head to rest. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.53,0:38:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 不要再哭泣 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Don't you cry no more. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.83,0:39:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 曾经我脱离了一切喧嚣和困惑 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Once I rose above the noise and confusion. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.40,0:39:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 只想透过幻象  一瞥现实 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Just to get a glimpse beyond this illusion. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.10,0:39:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我本越飞越高 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I was soaring ever higher. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.49,0:39:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.00,0:39:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那是亚当  约翰·温彻斯特另一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's Adam, John Winchester's other kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.67,0:39:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 但却太靠近天穹 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ But I flew too high. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.69,0:39:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他还和路西法一起被关在地狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still trapped in a cage in hell with Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.13,0:39:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 装作秉承信念之人 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Masquerading as a man with a reason. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.77,0:39:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我的伪装令人刮目 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ My charade is the event of the season. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.26,0:39:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 如果我自称心如明镜 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And if I claim to be a wise man. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.63,0:39:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 那我一定内心迷惘 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It surely means I don't know. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.57,0:39:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 前行吧  我不羁的孩子 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Carry on, my wayward son. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.12,0:39:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 你们最终会找到安宁 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ There'll be peace when you are done. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.70,0:39:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 躺下你们疲惫的身躯 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Lay your weary head to rest. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.54,0:40:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 不要再哭泣 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Don't you cry no more. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.09,0:40:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 前行吧 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Carry on. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.67,0:40:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-再见  -再见  抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye. - Oh. Bye. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.25,0:40:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30} Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.30,0:40:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你留给出版商的票  有人拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ticket you left for the publisher -- someone claimed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.32,0:40:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.52,0:40:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但是等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}But wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.10,0:41:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那么卡利奥佩是为我来的  还是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that mean that Calliope came for me or for --
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.37,0:41:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,谁在乎呢  去吧  大粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares? Go, fangirl!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.60,0:41:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢  太感谢你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you... so much for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.11,0:41:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道第二幕有点不靠谱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I know the second act is a little bit wonky
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.36,0:41:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,第一幕也有些问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the first act has some issues,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.46,0:41:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But... what did you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.67,0:41:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad.

